#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:2
msgid "Read the Conversation Timeline"
msgstr "阅读对话时间线"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:4
msgid ""
"The timeline is more than a chat transcript. It is a readable record of "
"what the agent tried, what changed, and what still needs your decision."
msgstr "时间线不只是聊天记录。它会清晰记录 agent 尝试了什么、发生了哪些变化，以及哪些事项仍需要你决定。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:8
msgid "What you may see"
msgstr "你可能看到的内容"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:10
msgid "**User and assistant messages**"
msgstr "**用户和助手消息**"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:11
msgid ""
"Messages support Markdown, code blocks, links to workspace resources, and"
" selectable text. Copy a message or copy all of its text when you need to"
" move an explanation into an issue or note."
msgstr "消息支持 Markdown、代码块、工作区资源链接和文本选择。需要将解释移到 issue 或笔记中时，可以复制一条消息或复制其中的全部文本。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:15
msgid "**Thinking and status**"
msgstr "**思考和状态**"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:16
msgid ""
"A run can show that the assistant is processing, waiting, stopped, or "
"reconnecting. Status details help you distinguish “still working” from "
"“waiting for approval.”"
msgstr "运行状态可能显示助手正在处理、等待、已停止或正在重新连接。状态详情可以帮助你区分“仍在工作”和“等待审批”。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:20
msgid "**Tool activity**"
msgstr "**工具活动**"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:21
msgid ""
"Each visible tool item describes an action such as reading a file, "
"editing text, searching the web, running a command, or inspecting Godot. "
"Expand an item when you need its inputs and result."
msgstr "每个可见的工具条目都会描述一项操作，例如读取文件、编辑文本、搜索网页、运行命令或检查 Godot。需要查看输入和结果时，请展开条目。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:25
msgid "**File changes**"
msgstr "**文件变更**"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:26
msgid ""
"File edits can include an inline diff. Review the added and removed lines"
" before accepting the overall result."
msgstr "文件编辑可能包含内联 diff。接受整体结果前，请审查新增和删除的行。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:29
msgid "**Plans and Todo progress**"
msgstr "**计划和 Todo 进度**"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:30
msgid ""
"Plan and Goal runs can show a plan, current step, completed steps, and "
"files changed. A progress indicator is a guide to the run, not proof that"
" the feature works."
msgstr "Plan 和 Goal 运行可以显示计划、当前步骤、已完成步骤和变更文件。进度指示器只是运行过程的导航，不是功能有效的证明。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:34
msgid "**Terminal output and diagnostics**"
msgstr "**终端输出和诊断**"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:35
msgid ""
"Read command output, exit status, Godot diagnostics, and warnings. A "
"missing validator is shown as missing; it is not silently treated as a "
"pass."
msgstr "阅读命令输出、退出状态、Godot 诊断和警告。缺失的验证器会明确显示为缺失，不会被默认为通过。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:40
msgid "Useful timeline actions"
msgstr "有用的时间线操作"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:42
msgid ""
"Search the conversation with **Find in conversation**. Move between user "
"turns with the conversation navigator. If you are far from the newest "
"response, use **Scroll to bottom** to return to the active run."
msgstr "使用 **Find in conversation** 搜索对话。通过对话导航器在用户轮次之间移动。如果你距离最新回复较远，请使用 **Scroll to bottom** 返回当前运行。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:46
msgid ""
"Select text in a message and choose **Ask AI** to ask a focused follow-up"
" about that text. You can add an optional note, attach the selection to "
"context, or delete an old selection question. This is useful for asking "
"“What does this error mean?” without copying a long passage into a new "
"prompt."
msgstr "选中消息中的文本并选择 **Ask AI**，可以针对这段文本提出后续问题。你可以添加可选备注，将选区附加到上下文，或删除旧的选区问题。这样可以直接询问“这个错误是什么意思？”，无需将长段落复制到新提示词中。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:52
msgid "Edit and resend or fork"
msgstr "编辑并重新发送，或创建分支"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:54
msgid ""
"Use **Edit and resend** on a user message when the request itself was "
"wrong. Use **Fork from here** when you want to try another model, "
"constraint, or approach while keeping the original session unchanged. A "
"fork records where it came from so you can return to the source session."
msgstr "当请求本身有误时，在用户消息上使用 **Edit and resend**。希望尝试其他模型、约束或方法，同时保持原会话不变时，使用 **Fork from here**。分支会记录来源，方便你返回源会话。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:60
msgid "Rich results"
msgstr "丰富结果"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:62
msgid ""
"Markdown code blocks can be copied or exported as files. Mermaid diagrams"
" can be rendered, viewed as source, copied, or exported as PNG. Image-"
"generation results can be inspected in the timeline when the selected "
"model and Skill support them."
msgstr "Markdown 代码块可以复制或导出为文件。Mermaid 图表可以渲染、查看源代码、复制或导出为 PNG。当所选模型和 Skill 支持图像生成时，可以在时间线中检查图像生成结果。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:68
msgid "Context shown on messages"
msgstr "消息中显示的上下文"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:70
msgid ""
"The context strip can show files, folders, selected lines, pasted text, "
"review comments, web elements, or selected message text. Expand the strip"
" when you need to confirm exactly what the agent received."
msgstr "上下文条可以显示文件、文件夹、选中行、粘贴文本、审查评论、网页元素或选中的消息文本。需要确认 agent 实际收到的内容时，请展开上下文条。"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:75
msgid "Context compression"
msgstr "上下文压缩"

#: ../../source/agent/timeline.rst:77
msgid ""
"When a session grows large, **Compress chat** can replace eligible "
"history with a structured, recoverable summary. Compression is "
"unavailable while a message is sending or a run is active, and protected "
"blocks are kept. Check the context estimate after compression before "
"continuing a complex task."
msgstr "会话变大时，**Compress chat** 可以将符合条件的历史记录替换为结构化且可恢复的摘要。发送消息或运行处于活动状态时无法压缩，受保护的区块会保留。继续复杂任务前，请检查压缩后的上下文估算。"
